# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Arduino / ESP32 build artifacts — NEVER commit
# (this repo went from ~2 MB to 1.3 GB on disk because these
# got pushed historically; tree is now clean, history retained)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.elf
*.map
*.bin.elf
*.partitions.bin
build/
.build/
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/

# Build outputs (firmware .bin files are intentionally KEPT —
# devices fetch them via raw.githubusercontent.com)
# *.bin                ← do NOT ignore; these are OTA payloads

# IDE / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.swp

# Secrets — extra layer (should never be here anyway)
*.pem
*.key
secrets.h
*credentials*.h
.env
